{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2021年，发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字与紫微斗数盘综合分析：  \n命主八字身强，大运乙卯伤官，流年辛丑正印，伤官见印，子丑合刃，劫财争合，易起纷争。紫微斗数中，2021辛丑年流年命宫在仆役宫丑宫，主星廉贞（大限化忌）七杀擎羊，构成“廉贞七杀擎羊”血光刑伤格，且大限忌星廉贞压入流年命宫，主因外人（仆役宫）引发突然灾祸。疾厄宫见火星，主突发血光。迁移宫无煞，但命宫煞忌交冲，归途遇险之象显著。父母宫虽有双忌，但命宫凶象直接指向自身横祸，而非母丧。综合推断需为B。  \n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1b_R2_P2_G3\\details_2025_b1b_R2_P2_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 211674, "response_id": "ddd9d7b9-2f4c-4df0-acb1-5234277bdc0e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 712, "completion_tokens": 10609, "total_tokens": 11321, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 640}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 10412}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 640, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 72}}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", "domain": "health", "question": "命主在2024年的健康状况如何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据紫微斗数命盘分析，命主生于1973年癸丑年，本命四化破军化禄、巨门化权、太阴化科、贪狼化忌。贪狼化忌落在本命父母宫，主嗜好、欲望过度引发暗疾。当前大限43-52岁，命宫在财帛宫天同，大限疾厄宫恰为本命父母宫，紫微贪狼坐守，贪狼生年化忌在此，健康潜伏隐患，尤与不良嗜好相关。\n\n2024甲辰流年，太岁在辰，流年疾厄宫在酉，即是贪狼化忌所在，流年太岁辰与酉六合引动化忌，健康问题凸显。流年天干甲，太阳化忌入本命夫妻宫（午），太阳主头面、五官；且流年迁移宫巨门化权（戌），巨门为暗曜，主呼吸道、肿块，组合指向鼻咽部病变。贪狼化忌属木，嗜好伤身，综合推断因长期无节制吸烟引发鼻癌。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1b_R2_P2_G3\\details_2025_b1b_R2_P2_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 62378, "response_id": "d995c3f9-d9bb-4ed8-bc36-4065f0a38002", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 709, "completion_tokens": 3339, "total_tokens": 4048, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 640}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 3095}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 640, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 69}}
